entries[179765] = { ["name"] = "Oakheart Tunic", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nChest Leather\n23 Armor\n+16 [Agility or Intellect]\n+23 Stamina\n+ 10 Versatility\n+ 22 Mastery\nDurability 140 / 140\nComplete Chapter 3 of your Covenant Campaign\n\nOakheart Raiment (0/9)\nOakheart Tunic\nOakheart Anklewraps\nOakheart Armguards\nOakheart Crest\nOakheart Britches\nOakheart Mantle\nOakheart Belt\nOakheart Bracers\nOakheart Cape\nOakheart Vestment\n(3) Set : Increases your out-of-combat regeneration in outdoor Shadowland zones. While in your Covenant's realm, the regeneration amount is increased.\n(5) Set : Soulshape's duration is increased by 4 sec and Flicker grants a short burst of speed while in outdoor Shadowland zones.\n(8) Set : Your spells and abilities have a low chance to summon a Fae Guardian to protect you for 30 sec, increasing your Primary Stat by 60 while alive and periodically healing 5 nearby allies for 450 health.\nSell Price:" }
